# VITE_FEATHERLESS_API_KEY: Optional API key for Featherless.ai online emergency triage/translation.
# Core Sanket mesh messaging, SOS, relay, ACK, sync, and crypto work 100% offline without this key
# and never touch the network. AI is advisory-only and disabled automatically when offline.
# This key ships inside the client bundle, so anyone can extract it from the built APK/web assets.
# Use a throwaway/demo key with a low spending cap — never a production or billing-linked key.
VITE_FEATHERLESS_API_KEY=""
